<title>JAPAN: Nishimoto Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nishimoto Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.10		vs	   16.33</p>
<p> Operating	  176    million    vs	  360    million</p>
<p> Current	    312    million    vs	  454    million</p>
<p> Net		  148    million    vs	   91    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.88 yen	  vs	   11.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares		8 million	  vs	   8 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.50 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nishimoto Sangyo Co Ltd sells X-ray film for medical use.</p>
